  m_text: 'TABLE TENNIS

    First to 5 points wins a game.

    Win 2 games to help
    the Elder remember.

    Return after one bounce.

    Swing your paddle to hit.

    Hold
    Grip on a high, descending ball for a smash.

    2 smashes or the hit target
    tire the Elder.

    Desktop: mouse + F swing; Space = Grip.

    Talk to Elder
    to restart.'
